#. :src: bpy.types.GreasePencilOpacityModifier.hardness_factor
msgid "Hardness Factor"
msgstr "கடினத்தன்மை காரணி"

#. :src: bpy.types.GreasePencilOpacityModifier.hardness_factor
msgid "Factor of stroke hardness"
